  "name": "pull-school-scope",
  "endpoint": "POST /sync/pull",
  "description": "A student who holds a role in a school but is enrolled on nothing. The school scope carries the school itself, its courses and the groups of those courses; no lesson, version or section rides it, because content belongs to the course scope and the student has no course scope at all. The groups are what a student who is not enrolled reads before asking for a place, which is why they ride the school and not the course: the course scope is exactly what they do not have. Both statuses travel \u2014 recruitment is closed by the status, and a group whose recruitment has closed still has to reach the device, or it stays in the catalogue for ever.",
